	<item>
		<title>By: Zahira</title>
		<link>http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=1070&#038;cpage=1#comment-30472</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Zahira]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 10 Aug 2014 15:40:25 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=1070#comment-30472</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[We have the funds for Gwenkins&#039; memorial bench, thanks to the amazing generosity of our many friends. It will be such a comfort to hike up to Gwen&#039;s bench in the woods and commune with her bubbly spirit in her native habitat. Thank you Beloved for the communion of those most dear to us who, having finished their earthly course, have returned home. May they continue to be an inspiration to us. 
Gwen, your memory still lights up my heart and your wonderful humor still fills me with joy and I must admit to missing your physical presence so deeply. May your soul be eternally blessed, dear One.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>We have the funds for Gwenkins&#8217; memorial bench, thanks to the amazing generosity of our many friends. It will be such a comfort to hike up to Gwen&#8217;s bench in the woods and commune with her bubbly spirit in her native habitat. Thank you Beloved for the communion of those most dear to us who, having finished their earthly course, have returned home. May they continue to be an inspiration to us.<br />
Gwen, your memory still lights up my heart and your wonderful humor still fills me with joy and I must admit to missing your physical presence so deeply. May your soul be eternally blessed, dear One.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
	</item>
